              "notes": "Demonstrated that active neurons form bona fide synapses onto glioma cells, with glutamatergic transmission to the tumor; this direct synaptic input into glioma validates that tumor cells can participate in synaptic networks ([pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7850064/#:~:text=The%20recent%20discovery%20of%20synaptic,cycle%20of%20enhanced%20neuronal%20activity))"
