          "type": "DOI",
          "notes": "Landmark study that first demonstrated electrical and synaptic integration of glioblastoma into neural circuits, showing that active neurons directly stimulate glioma cells via AMPA-receptor-mediated synapses to drive tumor growth"
        }
      ],
