              "notes": "Demonstrates that PGC-1α drives mitochondrial biogenesis and metabolic flexibility in glioblastoma; knockdown of PGC-1α in GBM cells reduces mitochondrial function and increases ROS, impairing proliferation ([pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30578297/#:~:text=involved%20in%20tumor%20growth%20and,1%CE%B1%20displayed%20ROS))"
